# 🏪 RateVerse - Store Rating Platform

A full-stack web application that allows users to submit ratings for stores registered on the platform. Users can rate stores from 1-5 stars, with role-based access control for admins and store owners.

---

## ✨ Features Implemented

### 🔐 Authentication & Authorization
- ✅ User signup with validation (name 20-60 chars, password requirements)
- ✅ User login with JWT token
- ✅ Role-based access control (User, Admin, Owner)
- ✅ Protected routes with middleware
- ✅ Password hashing with bcrypt
- ✅ Token expiration (7 days)

### 👤 User Features
- ✅ View all stores with search functionality
- ✅ Search stores by name or address
- ✅ Submit ratings (1-5 stars) for any store
- ✅ View average store ratings
- ✅ View personal rating for each store
- ✅ Update password with validation
- ✅ Logout functionality

### 👨‍💼 Admin Features
- ✅ View dashboard with statistics (total users, stores, ratings)
- ✅ Create new user accounts
- ✅ Add new stores to platform
- ✅ View all users with pagination
- ✅ Search users by name/email
- ✅ Filter users by role (User, Owner, Admin)
- ✅ View all stores list
- ✅ Search stores by name/address
- ✅ Full CRUD capabilities

### 🏢 Store Owner Features
- ✅ View personal store dashboard
- ✅ View all ratings for their store
- ✅ See average rating calculation
- ✅ Customer information display
- ✅ Rating timestamp tracking

### 📊 Technical Features
- ✅ RESTful API architecture
- ✅ PostgreSQL database with proper schema
- ✅ JWT authentication
- ✅ Error handling and validation
- ✅ CORS configuration
- ✅ Request logging middleware
- ✅ Responsive Tailwind CSS design
- ✅ Loading states and error boundaries
- ✅ Search and filter functionality

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Backend
- **Framework**: Express.js
- **Database**: PostgreSQL
- **Authentication**: JWT (jsonwebtoken)
- **Password Hashing**: bcrypt
- **Middleware**: CORS, body-parser

### Frontend
- **Framework**: React 19
- **Routing**: React Router v7
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4
- **HTTP Client**: Axios
- **Build Tool**: Vite

