## 🧪 Testing the Application

### Test Workflow

1. **Sign up as new user:**
   - Go to `/signup`
   - Enter name (20-60 chars), email, password (with uppercase & special char), address
   - Click "Sign Up"

2. **Login:**
   - Go to `/`
   - Use test credentials or signup credentials
   - Click "Login"

3. **Rate Stores (User):**
   - After login, see all stores
   - Click 1-5 stars to rate
   - Search stores by name/address
   - View average and personal ratings

4. **Admin Dashboard:**
   - Login with admin account
   - View statistics (users, stores, ratings)
   - Create new users
   - Add new stores
   - Search and filter users/stores

5. **Owner Dashboard:**
   - Login with owner account
   - View store ratings
   - See average rating and customer info

